  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 4.6% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.24B (4.6% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/05/thailand-moves-to-block-bitget-as-crypto-exchange-s-local-acquisition-faces-uncertainty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Thailand moves to block Bitget as crypto exchange&#x27;s local acquisition faces uncertainty</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/defi/ondo-plans-tokenized-anthropic-shares-from-ipo-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo Plans Tokenized Anthropic Shares From IPO Day</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/05/ukraine-s-central-bank-opposes-crypto-bill-citing-monetary-sovereignty-concerns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ukraine\u2019s central bank opposes crypto bill, citing monetary sovereignty concerns</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/11/05/hyperliquid-treasury-firm-seeking-u-s-regulatory-nod-as-a-domestic-futures-platform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyperliquid treasury firm seeking U.S. regulatory nod as a domestic futures platform</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
